    <li>Nail, mi v&agrave; c&aacute;c li&#7879;u tr&igrave;nh ph&#7909;c h&#7891;i v&#7867; &#273;&#7865;p t&#7921; nhi&ecirc;n</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>Quy tr&igrave;nh ch&#259;m s&oacute;c</h3>
  <p>M&#7895;i l&#7883;ch h&#7865;n b&#7855;t &#273;&#7847;u b&#7857;ng t&#432; v&#7845;n nhanh, ghi nh&#7853;n nhu c&#7847;u c&aacute; nh&acirc;n v&agrave; l&#7921;a ch&#7885;n s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m ph&ugrave; h&#7907;p. K&#7929; thu&#7853;t vi&ecirc;n gi&#7843;i th&iacute;ch c&aacute;c b&#432;&#7899;c ch&iacute;nh tr&#432;&#7899;c khi th&#7921;c hi&#7879;n &#273;&#7875; kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng n&#7855;m r&otilde; th&#7901;i l&#432;&#7907;ng, c&#7843;m gi&aacute;c trong li&#7879;u tr&igrave;nh v&agrave; c&aacute;ch ch&#259;m s&oacute;c sau bu&#7893;i h&#7865;n.</p>
  <h3>V&igrave; sao n&ecirc;n ch&#7885;n ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i?</h3>
  <p>Sakura Relax Home 100 uu tien ve sinh dung cu, kh&ocirc;ng gian yen tinh, bang gia cong khai va thai do phuc vu tan tam. H&#7891; s&#417; d&#7883;ch v&#7909; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c l&#432;u l&#7841;i &#273;&#7875; nh&#7919;ng l&#7847;n ch&#259;m s&oacute;c sau nh&#7845;t qu&aacute;n h&#417;n.</p>
